WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.747
The review queue contains patient 1003 and a NULL
For another

00:00:05.774 --> 00:00:11.681
patient such as 1001 PostgreSQL knows 1001 is not
equal to 1003

00:00:13.431 --> 00:00:19.071
But it cannot know whether 1001 is different from
the NULL value That

00:00:19.098 --> 00:00:25.357
unknown comparison prevents the full NOT IN
condition from becoming TRUE Run

00:00:25.384 --> 00:00:27.292
the query and observe the result
